# open the live Parent Portal, while parents stay on the school's website address.
# Netlify "proxies" the three paths below to the school server (HTTP 200 = rewrite, not redirect).
# Paste these lines at the TOP of the _redirects file in your Netlify site (create it in the
# folder you deploy, next to index.html), then redeploy.
# If the school server address ever changes, only change it here.
