/portal               https://pravidia-edu.bat-wrasse.ts.net/parent.html     200!
/portal/              https://pravidia-edu.bat-wrasse.ts.net/parent.html     200!
/parent.html          https://pravidia-edu.bat-wrasse.ts.net/parent.html     200!
/api/public/*         https://pravidia-edu.bat-wrasse.ts.net/api/public/:splat   200!
/uploads/*            https://pravidia-edu.bat-wrasse.ts.net/uploads/:splat      200!
/parent.webmanifest   https://pravidia-edu.bat-wrasse.ts.net/parent.webmanifest  200
/android-chrome-192x192.png https://pravidia-edu.bat-wrasse.ts.net/android-chrome-192x192.png 200
